This fixture exercises phpc's deterministic clean diagnostic metadata for the
current placeholder `mysqli_stmt` lifecycle. System PHP requires a fully
initialized MySQLi connection before `mysqli_stmt_init()` can create a usable
statement object; phpc uses this placeholder object only to expose clean
diagnostic reads while prepared binding, execution, result state, warning-chain
objects, host database state, PHP warning/error fidelity, and native database
lowering remain unsupported.
